      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The same goes for animated/overlay effects. As we've all probably already seen with Discord, they obscure entire profiles for several seconds and looping. The current beta effects already bleed into the content area slightly, which is deeply concerning...",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
